{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the twisted minds that brought you Universal Paperclips and Babble Royale comes a timeless tale about numbers going up and going down, the thrill of victory and the agony of defeat, reverse mergers, spooky action at a distance, and a 3-ton whale with a day job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/1e6a5294aebfea6a5184408964f2e5f1.poster.avif?t=1762365503\" width=780 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/1e6a5294aebfea6a5184408964f2e5f1.webm?t=1762365503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50/50. Totally random. Totally fair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You sit down after a tough day to play your favorite video game. Of course you have to wait 10 minutes to get into a match. When you finally do get into a game, you're up against the sweatiest kids you've ever seen. Meanwhile, the idiots on your team have apparently never even <i>heard</i> of a keyboard. After that guaranteed loss, it's another 10 minute wait just to get into a game with someone who screams at you the whole time and then leaves halfway through. As usual, you played your &quot;favorite&quot; video game for the entire night and the only thing you got was mad.\u00a0      <br><br>Sound familiar? We've been there. That's why we made Q-UP! <strong>Every single round of Q-UP is determined by the result of a coin flip</strong>, so every single round of Q-UP is completely fair. No more smurfs ruining your games. No more inters. No more tryhards. No more stupid reaction times or mechanics. Just perfectly fair matches, every single time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/6aca790b17b72ab0fcd9d9c1545216d9.avif?t=1762365503\" width=780 height=529 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ladder by earning the most Q</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dramatic battle for corporate power in the eSports industry and, if it's not too much trouble, decide the future of the universe</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 playable heroes, each with their own unique skills and abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4v4 team-based competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends, Solo-Q, or play the whole game single-player against bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 Items to discover and build around\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 400 skills to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique geometric trigger-based skill combo system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.38 \u00d7 10\u00b9\u00b9\u00b2 ways to play!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/f349c67f2bbf062db65f90cbb62f6fc4.poster.avif?t=1762365503\" width=780 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/f349c67f2bbf062db65f90cbb62f6fc4.webm?t=1762365503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you play, you'll experience the heart-stopping thrills of our patented, mathematically-perfect, quantum-powered matchmaking system. Will you make it to the top of the ladder or be trapped forever in Q-Lo hell? Don't ask me! Buy the game and find out!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/f6579d5fe287cf640f1dc0739be62491.poster.avif?t=1762365503\" width=780 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730790/extras/f6579d5fe287cf640f1dc0739be62491.webm?t=1762365503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Character Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3730790/fdea9f576e45f7f1afdf995cef20db01c1eac532.jpg"},{"name":"Jackpot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3730790/4ed2e441bb239b0ed9a924f70891f3f45b4eff27.jpg"},{"name":"Resurrection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3730790/85ea85a05feff53816ca04399a88016297ea39f2.jpg"},{"name":"Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3730790/d929d8cbe20723e7d39db76a9d1c893e327c8b7c.jpg"},{"name":"hoard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3730790/93757f484d97dd2d54b2636e083a0750f9a1d0b2.jpg"},{"name":"A-List","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3730790/df58e41d38806341f711a7e5efdbf373fd528d11.jpg"},{"name":"Hypercapitalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3730790/2e9d2c51d5c3d9fa7def0769c161fbe14d850bd0.jpg"},{"name":"CATCH_FIRE","path":"https://cdn.aka